#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:31 ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:68
#: 270eb11dca144f89bd3e2c4b7d9ce579 3644d52ada9546b5b2d57d1ecbe8ed89
msgid "**Type**: ``PubTatorTool``"
msgstr "**类型**：``PubTatorTool``"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:32 01a5cfb8343c4e5b98c6a3961feb6b33
msgid ""
"**Description**: Provides suggestions for the best‐matching standardized "
"PubTator IDs for a partial biomedical term (gene, disease, chemical, or "
"variant). Use this tool first to convert free‐text names into the stable "
"@IDs required by the other PubTator APIs."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：提供与部分生物医学术语（基因、疾病、化学物质或变异）最匹配的标准化 PubTator ID "
"的建议。首先使用此工具将自由文本名称转换为其他 PubTator API 所需的稳定 @ID。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:71
#: 8d948e6ef4ec45ff940c6f2413b417fe cad8b4c1bec048c5976194068dad29b4
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:36 dcd4209e3154419b8ec91372082573b2
msgid ""
"``text`` (string) (required) A few characters or the full name of the "
"biomedical concept you are trying to look up (e.g. “BRAF V6”)."
msgstr "``text``（字符串）（必填）您要查询的生物医学概念的几个字符或完整名称（例如：“BRAF V6”）。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:39 e6f276f638f14a31bef271a8739372c8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``entity_type`` (string) (optional) Optional filter to restrict "
"suggestions to a single category such as GENE, DISEASE, CHEMICAL, or "
"VARIANT."
msgstr "``entity_type``（字符串）（可选）可选过滤器，用于将建议限制为单一类别，例如基因（GENE）、疾病（DISEASE）、化学物质（CHEMICAL）或变体（VARIANT）。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:42 83ef0217645d4835bfe96cf433cf39a2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of suggestions to "
"return (1 - 50, default = 10)."
msgstr "``max_results``（整数）（可选）返回建议的最大数量（1 - 50，默认值 = 10）。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:45 ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:85
