msgid "**PubTator3_LiteratureSearch** (Type: PubTatorTool)"
msgstr "**PubTator3_LiteratureSearch**（类型：PubTator工具）"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:61 5944c8113f2d49e19ee44c2fc1a0861d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Find PubMed articles that match a keyword, a PubTator entity ID (e.g. "
"“@GENE\\_BRAF”), or an entit..."
msgstr "查找与关键词、PubTator实体ID（例如“@GENE_BRAF”）或实体匹配的PubMed文章..."

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst 2611ce7a3142417fa47f3891254cbba7
msgid "PubTator3_LiteratureSearch tool specification"
msgstr "PubTator3_LiteratureSearch 工具规格"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:67 e5eba376b4494c65b99d52e8d710b3db
msgid "**Name**: ``PubTator3_LiteratureSearch``"
msgstr "**名称**: ``PubTator3_LiteratureSearch``"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:69 6e8ff5bfdfac46aa9f6a0ad49246c14f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Description**: Find PubMed articles that match a keyword, a PubTator "
"entity ID (e.g. “@GENE\\_BRAF”), or an entity-to-entity relation "
"expression (e.g. "
"“relations:treat\\|@CHEMICAL\\_Doxorubicin\\|@DISEASE\\_Neoplasms”)."
msgstr "**描述**：查找与关键词、PubTator实体ID（例如“@GENE_BRAF”）或实体与实体关系表达式（例如“relations:treat|@CHEMICAL_Doxorubicin|@DISEASE_Neoplasms”）匹配的PubMed文章。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:73 740948c8f9a340a8a6082f1dab316574
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) What you want to search for. This can be "
"plain keywords, a single PubTator ID, or the special relation syntax "
"shown above."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）您想要搜索的内容。可以是普通关键词、单个 PubTator ID，或上述显示的特殊关系语法。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:76 9e7198b549f94374a6e69f95cbde15b5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``page`` (integer) (optional) Zero-based results page (optional; default "
"= 0)."
msgstr "``page``（整数）（可选）以零为基的结果页面（可选；默认值 = 0）。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:79 d46bb7407d064d7e9494d1632dcb8552
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``page_size`` (integer) (optional) How many PMIDs to return per page "
"(optional; default = 10; note: the PubTator3 API always returns 10 per "
"page regardless of this value)."
msgstr "``page_size``（整数）（可选）每页返回的PMID数量（可选；默认值=20，最大值=200）。"

#: ../../tools/pubtator_tools.rst:82 e75a7f3e260842f8bbf512d50b14d6f9
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(applied client-side). The PubTator3 API returns 10 results per page; "
"this parameter truncates the results to the requested count."
msgstr ""

